shortdesc Use Twitter's open source emojis through LaTeX commands
longdesc This package provides a simple wrapper which allows to use
longdesc Twitter's open source emojis through LaTeX commands. This
longdesc relies on images, so no fancy unicode-font stuff is needed and
longdesc it should work on every installation.
